    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Allow me to confess that I find you quite tangible for a phantasmagorical being.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I must say, this is really quite strange. You are the first living being I have ever met in this place. Nevertheless, I will introduce myself. I am the Judge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339880/extras/f06eeb31e4414625e1dc9d85f3bbac5d.avif?t=1755374176\" data-has-big width=1560 height=508 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Batter has a sacred mission to fulfill.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He seeks to purify the world. You, then, the controller, the soul that he harbors, must aid him in this laudable task. Alongside my sportive companion you will find it necessary to solve puzzles, rain blows upon certain hostile individuals of our wild zones, and oversee the headways and logistics of a network of swan boats and interurban locomotives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339880/extras/ab94d0ef21d9064819247abeea43d238.poster.avif?t=1755374176\" width=800 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339880/extras/ab94d0ef21d9064819247abeea43d238.webm?t=1755374176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >I, too, travel widely among the zones of this world.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open your wings and fly toward the zones ahead without hesitation! All of them are filled with strange and enchanting beings as well as every modern convenience. All of them appear, it must be said, to require the beneficient application of our friend the Batter\u2019s muscular wrist. Do not worry, my dear phantasm\u2014I, the Judge, will be with you (in spirit and body) at all the most crucial moments of your quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339880/extras/06cc910eaa849dac7be6c340e3b441b3.avif?t=1755374176\" data-has-big width=1560 height=508 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339880/extras/f79dec6c027144ea7544deee7cbd1c5a.webp?t=1755374176\" data-has-big width=800 height=2 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >I'm going to cut that insufferable smile right out of your face</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339880/extras/d40eb7f73ee7c40bd28333d1bda92edb.poster.avif?t=1755374176\" width=800 height=153 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339880/extras/d40eb7f73ee7c40bd28333d1bda92edb.webm?t=1755374176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How dare you talk to me? Why have you decided to be such a pain in my ass? The Queen chose me to protect Zone 1, and I've dedicated my whole life to it.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen. Get out of here, and take those ghosts with you, or I am going to kill you. I hope that's clear enough.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Allow me to confess that I find you quite tangible for a phantasmagorical being.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I must say, this is really quite strange. You are the first living being I have ever met in this place. Nevertheless, I will introduce myself. I am the Judge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339880/extras/f06eeb31e4414625e1dc9d85f3bbac5d.avif?t=1755374176\" data-has-big width=1560 height=508 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Batter has a sacred mission to fulfill.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He seeks to purify the world. You, then, the controller, the soul that he harbors, must aid him in this laudable task. Alongside my sportive companion you will find it necessary to solve puzzles, rain blows upon certain hostile individuals of our wild zones, and oversee the headways and logistics of a network of swan boats and interurban locomotives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339880/extras/ab94d0ef21d9064819247abeea43d238.poster.avif?t=1755374176\" width=800 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339880/extras/ab94d0ef21d9064819247abeea43d238.webm?t=1755374176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >I, too, travel widely among the zones of this world.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open your wings and fly toward the zones ahead without hesitation! All of them are filled with strange and enchanting beings as well as every modern convenience. All of them appear, it must be said, to require the beneficient application of our friend the Batter\u2019s muscular wrist. Do not worry, my dear phantasm\u2014I, the Judge, will be with you (in spirit and body) at all the most crucial moments of your quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339880/extras/06cc910eaa849dac7be6c340e3b441b3.avif?t=1755374176\" data-has-big width=1560 height=508 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339880/extras/f79dec6c027144ea7544deee7cbd1c5a.webp?t=1755374176\" data-has-big width=800 height=2 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >I'm going to cut that insufferable smile right out of your face</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339880/extras/d40eb7f73ee7c40bd28333d1bda92edb.poster.avif?t=1755374176\" width=800 height=153 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339880/extras/d40eb7f73ee7c40bd28333d1bda92edb.webm?t=1755374176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How dare you talk to me? Why have you decided to be such a pain in my ass? The Queen chose me to protect Zone 1, and I've dedicated my whole life to it.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen. Get out of here, and take those ghosts with you, or I am going to kill you. I hope that's clear enough.</p>",
    "short_description": "\u201cI\u2019m the Batter. I\u2019ve been entrusted with a sacred mission.\u201d -- One of the most influential RPGs of the last 20 years is finally coming to Steam. Take control of the Batter as he seeks to purify an uncanny and hopeless world haunted by specters, guided by a cryptic, grinning cat called The Judge.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French",
    "reviews": "\u201cI\u2019m blown away by it, I never thought that like a game like this would affect me that way. Holy crap that was awesome!\u201d<br>Markiplier<br><br>\u201cPlaying OFF, you can see why it has enjoyed a huge cultural impact over the last 17 years. It\u2019s a timeless piece that pushes what we believe to be standard video game convention, and the added content is a loving epilogue for long-time fans.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 GameWatcher<br><br>\u201cDespite the passage of time, OFF still holds up incredibly well. [...] It\u2019s still a well-written, bite-sized experience that deserves the attention of anyone who loves newer RPG maker games or games inspired by that genre.\u201d<br>8.5/10 \u2013 Checkpoint Gaming<br>",
